# Actual Budget — the keys stored in secrets.sops.json, one value each (`sopsgen
# apply` fills generated ones, `sopsedit` the rest). Values built from other
# secrets live in env.nix. Key set must match secrets.sops.json and
# tests/fixtures/stacks/actual.sops.json.

# Server password
# FIRST-RUN ONLY: actual_init POSTs it to /account/bootstrap and never reads it
# again; later changes belong in the client UI. openssl rand -base64 24
ACTUAL_INIT_PASSWORD=changeme_strong_password

# OIDC
# Inert until the ACTUAL_OPENID_* lines in compose.yaml are uncommented and
# `node scripts/enable-openid.js` has run. Values come from the Authentik
# provider for actual.svc.idanreed.com; the secret's twin is
# ACTUAL_OPENID_CLIENT_SECRET in headscale-vps/secrets.sops.yaml.
ACTUAL_OPENID_CLIENT_ID=changeme_authentik_client_id
